"He sniffed him, saying, “You remain as my inheritance,”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l004","ordinal":313532,"en":"And while Seytek stood weeping,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l005","ordinal":313533,"en":"Aichürök came wailing bitterly."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l006","ordinal":313534,"en":"When she saw the dapple-gray steed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l007","ordinal":313535,"en":"Your ill-fated noble sister-in-law"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l008","ordinal":313536,"en":"Clawed her face and shrieked:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l009","ordinal":313537,"en":"“His horse remains, but he is gone,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l010","ordinal":313538,"en":"My noble-hearted lord is nowhere to be seen,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l011","ordinal":313539,"en":"Is this what you are, filthy world?”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l012","ordinal":313540,"en":"So Aichürök lamented,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l013","ordinal":313541,"en":"“My precious one’s noble steed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l014","ordinal":313542,"en":"Would not tire when ridden on patrol,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l015","ordinal":313543,"en":"Would not weary after six months’ riding,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l016","ordinal":313544,"en":"Until he reached sixty years of age"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l017","ordinal":313545,"en":"His fangs would not jut out, nor would he grow old,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l018","ordinal":313546,"en":"He would not falter when ridden into combat."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l019","ordinal":313547,"en":"He would not sicken when ridden with the baggage train;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l020","ordinal":313548,"en":"But you are here, and the hero is gone."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l021","ordinal":313549,"en":"When I think of it, what dreadful misery!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l022","ordinal":313550,"en":"My ruined lord, come and take him!”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l023","ordinal":313551,"en":"So Aichürök"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l024","ordinal":313552,"en":"Raised her voice in a piercing cry,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l025","ordinal":313553,"en":"And at her white face, fair as a plane tree,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l026","ordinal":313554,"en":"She tore and tore;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l027","ordinal":313555,"en":"Dark blood flowed where she clawed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l028","ordinal":313556,"en":"And all strength left your sister-in-law."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l029","ordinal":313557,"en":"Her gray pacer went ambling on,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l030","ordinal":313558,"en":"While the blood streaming down both cheeks"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l031","ordinal":313559,"en":"Flowed over the gray pacer’s mane,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l032","ordinal":313560,"en":"Running down a whip-length."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l033","ordinal":313561,"en":"Overcome by grievous affliction,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l034","ordinal":313562,"en":"She threw herself down when she saw him."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l035","ordinal":313563,"en":"Shrieking at the sight of Buurul,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l036","ordinal":313564,"en":"Poor Aichürök"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l037","ordinal":313565,"en":"Fell down as though dead."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l038","ordinal":313566,"en":"She had settled at the cliffside camp,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l039","ordinal":313567,"en":"Bereft of her noble-hearted lord,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b002:l040","ordinal":313568,"en":"And had come to bear a wretched name."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l001","ordinal":313569,"en":"Before my lion-hearted father,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l002","ordinal":313570,"en":"If only I might die as a sacrifice!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l003","ordinal":313571,"en":"When even a beast grieves like this,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l004","ordinal":313572,"en":"I am human—I am his son;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l005","ordinal":313573,"en":"How can I endure it,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l006","ordinal":313574,"en":"When the beast comes neighing,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l007","ordinal":313575,"en":"Lamenting thunderously beneath me?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l008","ordinal":313576,"en":"The beast spoke a word"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l009","ordinal":313577,"en":"That said, “Let my noble father not be dead.”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l010","ordinal":313578,"en":"It drove a thought into my breast:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l011","ordinal":313579,"en":"“If my lion-hearted father were alive,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l012","ordinal":313580,"en":"Leading the way and fighting foes,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l013","ordinal":313581,"en":"If my bloodthirsty father were here,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l014","ordinal":313582,"en":"I would don my chain-mail cap"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l015","ordinal":313583,"en":"And strike the enemy head-on."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l016","ordinal":313584,"en":"With my noble, lion-hearted father,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l017","ordinal":313585,"en":"I did not die as his companion;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l018","ordinal":313586,"en":"I did not crush the approaching enemy,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l019","ordinal":313587,"en":"Nor tear them limb from limb."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l020","ordinal":313588,"en":"My precious heroic father’s"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l021","ordinal":313589,"en":"Robe worn on ceremonial occasions—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l022","ordinal":313590,"en":"I did not put on that bulletproof coat."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l023","ordinal":313591,"en":"If my dear father were alive,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l024","ordinal":313592,"en":"I would ask for and mount my Buurul,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l025","ordinal":313593,"en":"The steed no bullet could reach,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l026","ordinal":313594,"en":"And charge the foe with a battle cry."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l027","ordinal":313595,"en":"With my lion-hearted father,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l028","ordinal":313596,"en":"I never rode as his companion."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l029","ordinal":313597,"en":"I am left an ill-fated orphan;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l030","ordinal":313598,"en":"My leopard of a father, come and take me."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l031","ordinal":313599,"en":"Your beast stands neighing,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0265:b003:l032","ordinal":313600,"en":"Your orphan stands crying aloud."}]
